    "shortDefinition": "The polite 'you' for strangers, officials and colleagues."
  },
  "intro": {
    "title": "Du or Sie?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Sie (capital S) is the formal you, for strangers, shop staff, officials and many colleagues. It takes the same verb form as 'they': Sie sind, Sie haben. Among friends, family, children and young people, it's du."
    ]
  },
